{{ template "agents-shared.md" . }}

Pickforge Lanes is available through the `pickforge-lanes` MCP server. Read `lanes_models`, choose task kind, effort and mode, then spawn independent work when useful. Prefer read-only for reviews; use a separate writable lane for test execution. Collect with `lanes_wait` before reporting completion and verify the result before `lanes_assess`. Use `lanes_report` to compare outcomes. Codex uses explicit waits and Stop reminders; Pi automatic continuation is not available here.
